**Architectural position.** This module must be a leaf: zero imports, no I/O, no environment reads, no side effects at import time. Anything that reads `process.env` or a ledger file here would make the invariant report situational, and an invariant that varies by environment is not an invariant. Consumers (orchestrator, router, evidence/integrity tests) depend inward on it; it depends on nothing.

**Alternative edge-case safeguards I chose over the naive literal-return form:**

